{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1514534-trying-to-remember-a-supernatural-mystery-show","id":1514534,"title":"Trying to Remember a Supernatural Mystery Show","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-06-10T18:37:14-07:00","id":1514534,"title":"Trying to Remember a Supernatural Mystery Show","content":"I want to say it was similar to Ripley's Believe It or Not.<br /> <br /> You had a host who would introduce 3 strange stories and would say one of them is false while the others were true. Then the episode would show the stories and at the end the host would talk about each and then reveal which one was false.<br /> <br /> Does this ring a bell for anyone?<br /> \u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-10T19:30:56-07:00","id":1514541,"title":"","content":"I think you might be thinking of &quot;Beyond Belief: Fact or Fiction&quot; though the specific &quot;one true story and multiple false ones&quot; premise has been done in lots of different formats. Beyond Belief hosted by Johnathan Frakes was shot in a very similar style to the Dean Cain run hosting Ripley's Believe It or Not around the same time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-10T20:23:03-07:00","id":1514542,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1514534-trying-to-remember-a-supernatural-mystery-show?p=1514541#post1514541\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think you might be thinking of &quot;Beyond Belief: Fact or Fiction&quot; though the specific &quot;one true story and multiple false ones&quot; premise has been done in lots of different formats. Beyond Belief hosted by Johnathan Frakes was shot in a very similar style to the Dean Cain run hosting Ripley's Believe It or Not around the same time.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Turns out it was in Beyond Belief that I was thinking of.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}